{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 06 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">可提示分割：把固定类别头改造成交互式纠错接口</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Promptable Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_034_sam_2-title\">SAM 2</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">在 SAM 提示式 decoder 外加入 memory attention、mask-conditioned memory encoder 和 object pointer，构成可交互的流式时序闭环。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Extends promptable SAM with a streaming memory bank, memory cross-attention, mask-conditioned memory encoder, and occlusion score head across sequences.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">图像或视频帧、当前帧提示及历史对象记忆</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Video stream or 3D slice stack + spatial prompts (points/box/mask) on one or more reference frames</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">当前帧对象 mask，并更新供后续帧读取的记忆</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Temporally/slice-propagated segmentation masks with updated object memory state</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.5</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.00714\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_034_sam_2')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_034_sam_2')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"SAM 2 original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/4412061ad8f185d841d3.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.5</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_034_sam_2', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_034_sam_2\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_034_sam_2')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_034_sam_2', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_034_sam_2\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">当前帧</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">同一接口既处理单张图像，也处理视频流中的一帧。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests video stream or 3d slice stack + spatial prompts (points/box/mask) on one or more reference frames and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"同一接口既处理单张图像，也处理视频流中的一帧。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests video stream or 3d slice stack + spatial prompts (points/box/mask) on one or more reference frames and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"当前帧\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_034_sam_2', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">当前帧</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">同一接口既处理单张图像，也处理视频流中的一帧。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests video stream or 3d slice stack + spatial prompts (points/box/mask) on one or more reference frames and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"层次化视觉 backbone 输出多尺度当前帧特征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Hiera Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Hiera Image Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Hiera Image Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_034_sam_2', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Hiera Image Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">层次化视觉 backbone 输出多尺度当前帧特征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Hiera Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"点、框或 mask 提示编码为当前对象的条件 tokens。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Prompt Encoder within the core streaming promptable segmentation memory computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Prompt Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Prompt Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_034_sam_2', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Prompt Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">点、框或 mask 提示编码为当前对象的条件 tokens。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Prompt Encoder within the core streaming promptable segmentation memory computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"保存近期提示帧/预测帧的空间记忆与对象指针，并控制容量。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Memory Bank within the core streaming promptable segmentation memory computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Memory Bank\" data-node-name-en=\"Memory Bank\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_034_sam_2', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Memory Bank</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">保存近期提示帧/预测帧的空间记忆与对象指针，并控制容量。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Memory Bank within the core streaming promptable segmentation memory computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"当前帧 tokens 通过 self-attention 与 cross-attention 检索历史对象证据。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Memory Attention within the core streaming promptable segmentation memory computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Memory Attention\" data-node-name-en=\"Memory Attention\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_034_sam_2', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Memory Attention</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">当前帧 tokens 通过 self-attention 与 cross-attention 检索历史对象证据。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Memory Attention within the core streaming promptable segmentation memory computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"融合当前提示、带记忆的图像特征与对象指针，预测候选 mask。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs SAM Mask Decoder within the core streaming promptable segmentation memory computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"SAM Mask Decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"SAM Mask Decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_034_sam_2', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>SAM Mask Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">融合当前提示、带记忆的图像特征与对象指针，预测候选 mask。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs SAM Mask Decoder within the core streaming promptable segmentation memory computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从 mask token 提取紧凑对象身份向量，帮助跨帧区分对象。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Object Pointer within the core streaming promptable segmentation memory computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Object Pointer\" data-node-name-en=\"Object Pointer\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_034_sam_2', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Object Pointer</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从 mask token 提取紧凑对象身份向量，帮助跨帧区分对象。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Object Pointer within the core streaming promptable segmentation memory computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"输出对象 mask、质量/存在性信息，可接受下一轮纠正提示。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Mask within the core streaming promptable segmentation memory computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"当前帧 Mask\" data-node-name-en=\"Mask\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_034_sam_2', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">当前帧 Mask</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Mask</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">输出对象 mask、质量/存在性信息，可接受下一轮纠正提示。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Mask within the core streaming promptable segmentation memory computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将预测 mask 与当前图像特征融合、压缩为空间记忆表示。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Memory Encoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"Memory Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Memory Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_034_sam_2', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Memory Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将预测 mask 与当前图像特征融合、压缩为空间记忆表示。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Memory Encoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"新空间记忆和 object pointer 写入 bank，供后续帧读取。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces temporally/slice-propagated segmentation masks with updated object memory state via update.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"流式记忆更新\" data-node-name-en=\"update\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_034_sam_2', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">流式记忆更新</span><span class=\"lang-en\">update</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">新空间记忆和 object pointer 写入 bank，供后续帧读取。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces temporally/slice-propagated segmentation masks with updated object memory state via update.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"SAM 2 Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · SAM 2 读取历史记忆并把当前 mask 写回</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Streaming Memory Attention Conditioning Current Frame/Slice on Past Prompted Masks</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"SAM 2：核心公式 · SAM 2 读取历史记忆并把当前 mask 写回\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"34\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"11.272084pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.736752 -68.976178 346.058494 11.272084\" width=\"346.058494pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M7.285258 0V-.158807C6.61033-.218359 6.521001-.267986 6.521001-.5856C6.521001-.754332 6.540852-.873437 6.63018-1.19105L7.851007-5.588011C8.029665-6.183537 8.079292-6.233164 8.664891-6.322492V-6.481299H7.007346L3.672405-1.588067L3.126507-6.481299H1.330006V-6.322492C1.826277-6.292716 2.064487-6.183537 2.064487-5.955252C2.064487-5.875849 2.024786-5.726967 1.965233-5.54831L1.875904-5.250547L1.846128-5.141367L.794034-1.449111C.486346-.416868 .337464-.218359-.178658-.158807V0H1.786576V-.158807C1.280379-.198508 1.081871-.317613 1.081871-.595525C1.081871-.704705 1.121572-.942915 1.1712-1.121572L2.342399-5.419279L2.94785 0H3.116582L6.858465-5.56816L5.578086-.903213C5.419279-.377166 5.220771-.228285 4.575619-.158807V0H7.285258Z\" id=\"m034_g13-34\"></path><path d=\"M4.208378-6.084282C4.208378-6.451523 3.841137-6.729435 3.354792-6.