96448\" xlink:href=\"#m034_g17-49\" y=\"-58.764664\"></use><use x=\"245.930924\" xlink:href=\"#m034_g13-150\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use><use x=\"250.261296\" xlink:href=\"#m034_g13-60\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use><use x=\"257.889193\" xlink:href=\"#m034_g10-67\" y=\"-58.764664\"></use><use x=\"261.33276\" xlink:href=\"#m034_g13-150\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use><use x=\"265.73287\" xlink:href=\"#m034_g13-62\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use><use x=\"271.049431\" xlink:href=\"#m034_g10-67\" y=\"-58.764664\"></use><use x=\"274.492998\" xlink:href=\"#m034_g7-186\" y=\"-60.259044\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">SAM 缺少跨帧时间一致性和纠错记忆</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Static 2D SAM required re-prompting every frame or slice independently, lacking temporal or inter-slice memory propagation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用 streaming memory 在图像和视频中传播 prompt 与对象状态</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Condition current-frame image features on a FIFO memory bank of past prompted frames and predicted object pointers via memory attention.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">memory bank、任意帧交互纠正与大规模 SA-V 数据引擎</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Streaming memory attention + mask-conditioned memory encoder + occlusion prediction head + SA-V video data engine.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">适合内镜、超声视频和 CT/MRI 切片提示传播</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Enables rapid interactive propagation of prompts across surgical endoscopy videos, echocardiography, and 3D CT/MRI slice stacks.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">交互工具潜力高；相邻切片不等于真实 3D 几何</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">High utility for interactive 3D/video annotation; sequential slice tracking does not replace native 3D volumetric topology priors.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">把视频分割建模为带外部记忆的流式推理：当前帧只读取有限历史状态，不重复处理整段视频。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">空间 memory 保存对象外观与位置，object pointer 保存紧凑身份，两者共同降低遮挡后的身份漂移。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">预测 mask 经 memory encoder 写回状态，形成 mask→memory→未来帧 attention 的显式闭环。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Condition current-frame image features on a FIFO memory bank of past prompted frames and predicted object pointers via memory attention.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Streaming memory attention + mask-conditioned memory encoder + occlusion prediction head + SA-V video data engine.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Streaming Memory Attention Conditioning Current Frame/Slice on Past Prompted Masks.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可用于内镜、超声视频或切片序列的交互传播，但误分割也会写入记忆并累积漂移。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">三维 CT/MR 切片不是自然视频；各向异性层厚和突变解剖要求按体数据重新验证传播顺序。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Enables rapid interactive propagation of prompts across surgical endoscopy videos, echocardiography, and 3D CT/MRI slice stacks.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: High utility for interactive 3D/video annotation; sequential slice tracking does not replace native 3D volumetric topology priors.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.iclr.cc/paper_files/paper/2025/file/45c1f6a8cbf2da59ebf2c802b4f742cd-Paper-Conference.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>SAM 2: Segment Anything in Images and Videos</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam2\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
